{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y胜，整块大字能直接交代人物在做什么、为什么这样做，X的放大词组往往需要依赖小字才能拼出完整意思。small：X胜，小字对人物关系、心理转折的补充更有用，也更容易挂回主线；Y有些屏幕连续用多个相近比喻描写同一种情绪，补充增量偏小。core、fine：X胜，X更清楚地呈现亲密带来的幸福与尚未失去就已经开始的舍不得，尤其是幸福中已经掺入悲伤的细腻体验，具体辨识度也更高。concise：Y胜，主线叙述收得更短，少了一些回顾和解释性重复；human：平，两版主体措辞大体相近，差异主要是排版和内容取舍，没有足够明确的口语自然度优势；load：X胜，放大的短语普遍较短，扫读速度更容易与停留时间匹配，Y有几屏连续出现较多偏长的大块。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "da81f4ee-efaa-4606-a254-4f8a656cd879", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T213420016647Z", "elapsed_seconds": 183.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T21:37:23.550874+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f1b881af7326316449513c824316175d8ea8d5378912c826b4a79fa751922cf5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g